              "sourceRegion": "Question 2a, upper-left sketch",
              "description": "Common-axis equation-driven sketch with two coloured parabolas, unnumbered double-ended axes and curve arrowheads. Corrected to show tangency rather than crossings.",
              "mathematics": "y=x^2-2 and y=-(x-3)^2+2.5 touch at (1.5,0.25). Unequal axis units are deliberate; source ranges are unspecified.",
