        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(1.5,\\,0.25)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2-2&=-x^2+6x-6.5\\\\2x^2-6x+4.5&=0\\\\x^2-3x+2.25&=0\\\\(x-1.5)^2&=0\\\\x&=1.5\\end{align*}$$\nSubstitute into $y=x^2-2$:\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=(1.5)^2-2\\\\y&=0.25\\end{align*}$$\nThe curves touch at $(1.5,\\,0.25)$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 52
