        "answer": {
          "short": "No points of intersection, since $\\Delta<0$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2+7&=-x^2+6x-9\\\\2x^2-6x+16&=0\\\\x^2-3x+8&=0\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}\\Delta&=(-3)^2-4(1)(8)\\\\\\Delta&=-23\\end{align*}$$\nSince $\\Delta<0$, there are no real solutions and no points of intersection.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 47
